{"seq":2,"slug":"modal-interchange","title":"调式互换与借用和弦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/modal-interchange","wordCount":1448,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"调式互换与借用和弦\">调式互换与借用和弦</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>调式互换是在保持调性中心不变的前提下，临时从同主音（平行）大小调&quot;借&quot;和弦，为和声引入另一种调式的色彩而不构成转调——共同的主音保证了整体统一，因此听感&quot;惊喜但不突兀&quot;。核心是把它与转调区分开：借来的只是色彩，不是新的调中心。常用借用和弦（♭III、iv、♭VI、♭VII、♭II）各有固定色彩与用法，其中 ♭VI、♭VII 在现代流行与配乐中频率最高，拿坡里和弦（♭II⁶）则提供最暗的下属色彩。后文常用借用、进行模式与当代普及都由此展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调式互换的基本原理\">调式互换的基本原理</h2><p>调式互换（Modal Interchange/Modal Mixture）是指在大调作品中临时借用同主音小调（平行小调）的和弦，或在小调作品中借用同主音大调的和弦。这种手法不构成转调——调性中心不变，只是瞬间引入了&quot;另一个调式的色彩&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C 大调中借用 C 小调的和弦</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C 大调中借用 C 小调的和弦}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大调中借用</span><span class=\"mord\"> C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小调的和弦</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>如：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>m</mi><mtext> 来自 C 小调</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{如：} C \\to F \\to Fm \\to C \\quad (Fm \\text{ 来自 C 小调})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">如：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">来自</span><span class=\"mord\"> C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小调</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>借用和弦的引入打破了单一调式的&quot;纯净感&quot;，为和声增添了意外的色彩深度。人耳对于这种混合的反应通常是&quot;惊喜但不突兀&quot;——因为共同的主音保证了整体的统一感。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;C 大调和弦池&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;I C, ii Dm, iii Em&lt;br/&gt;IV F, V G, vi Am, vii° B°&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;C 小调和弦池&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;i Cm, ii° D°, III E♭&lt;br/&gt;iv Fm, v Gm, VI A♭, VII B♭&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;调式互换:&lt;br/&gt;从小调池借用&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"C 大调和弦池\"] --&gt; B[\"I C, ii Dm, iii Em&lt;br/&gt;IV F, V G, vi Am, vii° B°\"]\n    C[\"C 小调和弦池\"] --&gt; D[\"i Cm, ii° D°, III E♭&lt;br/&gt;iv Fm, v Gm, VI A♭, VII B♭\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"调式互换:&lt;br/&gt;从小调池借用\"]\n    C --&gt; E</pre><h2 id=\"常用借用和弦\">常用借用和弦</h2><p>从平行小调借入大调中的常用和弦：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>借用和弦</th>\n<th>在C大调中</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>色彩效果</th>\n<th>经典用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>♭III</td>\n<td>E♭</td>\n<td>自然小调</td>\n<td>壮阔、意外</td>\n<td>摇滚高潮段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iv</td>\n<td>Fm</td>\n<td>自然小调</td>\n<td>哀伤、深情</td>\n<td>副歌&quot;转暗&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>♭VI</td>\n<td>A♭</td>\n<td>自然小调</td>\n<td>宏大、电影感</td>\n<td>配乐标志性色彩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>♭VII</td>\n<td>B♭</td>\n<td>自然小调</td>\n<td>开阔、摇滚</td>\n<td>硬摇滚/英伦摇滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>♭II (Neapolitan)</td>\n<td>D♭</td>\n<td>特殊</td>\n<td>阴暗、古典</td>\n<td>终止前张力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 ♭VI 和 ♭VII 是流行音乐和影视配乐中使用频率最高的借用和弦。它们的加入往往伴随着戏剧性的&quot;拓宽感&quot;——如同画面从室内切到广阔天际。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调式互换的进行模式\">调式互换的进行模式</h2><p>几种经典的调式互换进行：</p>\n<p><strong>Backdoor 进行</strong>：IV → ♭VII → I</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F \\to B\\flat \\to C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>♭VII → I 的低音上行全音进行（非传统的 V → I 半音进行）产生了&quot;从后门回家&quot;的感觉——解决但不紧张。</p>\n<p><strong>♭VI → ♭VII → I（&quot;Mario 进行&quot;）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\flat \\to B\\flat \\to C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两个借用和弦通过全音阶梯上行回到主和弦，产生英雄般的上升感。在电子游戏音乐与动作电影配乐中极为常见。</p>\n<p><strong>Picardy Third（皮卡迪三度）</strong>：小调作品在最终主和弦使用大三和弦（i → I），制造&quot;阴霾散去&quot;的光明感。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 经典调式互换进行&#10;        A[&quot;♭VI → ♭VII → I&lt;br/&gt;(英雄上升)&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;IV → iv → I&lt;br/&gt;(明转暗回光)&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;I → ♭VII → IV → I&lt;br/&gt;(摇滚标准)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 经典调式互换进行\n        A[\"♭VI → ♭VII → I&lt;br/&gt;(英雄上升)\"]\n        B[\"IV → iv → I&lt;br/&gt;(明转暗回光)\"]\n        C[\"I → ♭VII → IV → I&lt;br/&gt;(摇滚标准)\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"拿坡里和弦\">拿坡里和弦</h2><p>拿坡里和弦（Neapolitan Chord, N 或 ♭II）是降低的 II 级大三和弦，通常以第一转位出现（♭II⁶）。它提供了极其暗沉的下属功能色彩，常出现在终止前作为属和弦的预备。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>在 C 大调中：</mtext><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>F</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>以 F 为低音</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{在 C 大调中：} N^6 = D\\flat/F \\quad (D\\flat - F - A\\flat, \\text{以 F 为低音})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在</span><span class=\"mord\"> C </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大调中：</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">♭/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">以</span><span class=\"mord\"> F </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为低音</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>典型用法：</mtext><mi>I</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>→</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{典型用法：} I \\to N^6 \\to V \\to I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">典型用法：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\to D\\flat/F \\to G \\to C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">♭/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>拿坡里和弦的特殊色彩来源于降低的根音（♭2）——这是调内最暗的音级，它的出现立即为音乐蒙上一层阴影。Beethoven、Chopin 大量使用这一和弦。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构成</td>\n<td>降II级大三和弦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常用位置</td>\n<td>第一转位（♭II⁶）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能</td>\n<td>下属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后接</td>\n<td>V 或 I⁶₄-V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情感</td>\n<td>暗沉、宿命感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调式互换在当代音乐中的普及\">调式互换在当代音乐中的普及</h2><p>2020 年代的流行音乐中，调式互换已从&quot;高级技法&quot;变为&quot;标准配置&quot;。这一转变的推动力来自几个方面：</p>\n<p><strong>影视配乐的反向渗透</strong>：Hans Zimmer、Ludwig Göransson 等配乐家大量使用 ♭VI、♭VII 制造的&quot;电影感&quot;和弦色彩通过 Marvel/DC 电影传播到大众耳朵，使听众对这些和弦建立了&quot;史诗&quot;的条件反射。流行歌手开始主动引入这些色彩以增强歌曲的&quot;戏剧性&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>Billie Eilish 效应</strong>：Billie Eilish 与 Finneas 的制作中频繁使用 iv、♭VI → V 等调式互换进行，其全球性成功证明了&quot;暗色流行&quot;的商业可行性，引发了大量模仿。</p>\n<p><strong>Lo-Fi/Bedroom Pop 的色彩探索</strong>：独立制作人在有限的和弦知识框架内，通过直觉式地加入&quot;听起来好听的非标准和弦&quot;，实质上重新发现了调式互换的美学价值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时代</th>\n<th>调式互换使用频率</th>\n<th>主要推动者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1960s</td>\n<td>摇滚/披头士引入</td>\n<td>Beatles, Bowie</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1980s</td>\n<td>金属/新浪潮</td>\n<td>Iron Maiden, Depeche Mode</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000s</td>\n<td>配乐标配</td>\n<td>Zimmer, Shore</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2020s</td>\n<td>流行标配</td>\n<td>Eilish, Olivia Rodrigo</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调式互换借用平行大小调的和弦，调性中心不变，不算转调。</li>\n<li>常用借用和弦：♭III、iv、♭VI、♭VII、♭II，各有色彩与典型用法。</li>\n<li>♭VI 与 ♭VII 是流行与配乐中使用频率最高的借用和弦。</li>\n<li>经典进行模式：Backdoor（IV-♭VII-I）、Mario 进行（♭VI-♭VII-I）、Picardy 三度。</li>\n<li>拿坡里和弦是降 II 级大三，多用第一转位，功能为下属，色彩暗沉。</li>\n<li>2020 年代调式互换已从&quot;高级技法&quot;变为流行&quot;标准配置&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>调式互换借用同主音小调的和弦，前置需理解大小调与调式色彩：<a href=\"../../music-theory-foundations/pitch-rhythm/modes-basics\">调式基础</a></li>\n<li>借用和弦（iv、♭VI、♭VII）改变了功能流动，对照功能和声框架：<a href=\"../chord-progressions/functional-harmony\">功能和声与进行模型</a></li>\n<li>与三全音替代并列的另一现代色彩扩展手法：<a href=\"jazz-harmony\">爵士和声体系</a></li>\n<li>当代流行中借用和弦的实际进行用例，见常用进行的创新方向：<a href=\"../chord-progressions/common-progressions\">流行与古典常用和声进行</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调式互换与借用和弦","id":"调式互换与借用和弦"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"调式互换的基本原理","id":"调式互换的基本原理"},{"level":2,"text":"常用借用和弦","id":"常用借用和弦"},{"level":2,"text":"调式互换的进行模式","id":"调式互换的进行模式"},{"level":2,"text":"拿坡里和弦","id":"拿坡里和弦"},{"level":2,"text":"调式互换在当代音乐中的普及","id":"调式互换在当代音乐中的普及"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"爵士和声体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/jazz-harmony"},"next":{"title":"新和声语言与非功能体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/new-harmonic-language"}}